{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Submit an asynchronous planning calculation"},"description":"Accept an ordinary or heuristic calculation asynchronously; expected_revision maps to base_revision. Keep request_id unchanged for retries. Missing necessary facts returns 422 needs_information with revision and versioned schema references, without accepting a task or reserving quota; supplement facts then use a new revision/request_id. Accepted work returns a persistent calculation_id immediately; use get_planning_calculation to poll and list_planning_calculations with request_id to recover a timed-out submission. parent_calculation_id and comparison must belong to this account and non-VIP channel. Heuristic may consume the account\u2019s quota. No VIP, arbitrary engines or budgets. Requires the authenticated One U Education account and declared planning scope; credentials and user identity are never tool arguments.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"__schema0":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"end_on":{"type":["string","null"]},"excluded":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"excluded_periods":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"end":{"anyOf":[{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"const":"","type":"string"},{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/__schema2"},"maxItems":0,"type":"array"}]},{"type":"null"}]},"start":{"anyOf":[{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"const":"","type":"string"},{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/__schema1"},"maxItems":0,"type":"array"}]},{"type":"null"}]}},"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"expected_result_on":{"type":["string","null"]},"full_time_hours":{"anyOf":[{"anyOf":[{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":168,"type":"integer"},{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":168,"type":"number"}]},{"type":"null"}]},"lodge_on":{"type":["string","null"]},"occ":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^\\d{6}(?:_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+)?$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"paid":{"type":["boolean","n